---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
const lastUpdated = "1 May 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Terms & Conditions — Garden Route Restaurants"
  description="Terms and conditions for use of gardenroute-restaurants.co.za."
>
  <Nav />

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 list-none p-0 m-0">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-gray-600 no-underline">Home</a></li>
        <li>›</li>
        <li class="text-gray-600 font-medium">Terms & Conditions</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-8">

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. About this site</h2>
        <p>gardenroute-restaurants.co.za ("the Site", "we", "us") is an independent restaurant directory covering the Garden Route region of South Africa. The Site is operated as a private venture and is not affiliated with any restaurant, hospitality group, or tourism body unless explicitly stated.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Accuracy of information</h2>
        <p>We make every effort to ensure that restaurant listings — including trading hours, contact details, and pricing — are accurate and current. However, we cannot guarantee that all information is error-free at the time you access it. Restaurant details change frequently. We recommend confirming hours, availability, and pricing directly with the restaurant before visiting.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">If you spot an error or outdated information, please email us at <a href="mailto:info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za</a> and we will correct it promptly.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Listings and editorial independence</h2>
        <p>Listings on this Site are compiled at our editorial discretion. Inclusion of a restaurant does not constitute an endorsement, and exclusion does not imply a negative assessment. We reserve the right to add, remove, or update listings at any time without notice.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Some listings may in future be promoted or featured on a paid basis. Where this is the case, it will be clearly indicated on the listing.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. User submissions</h2>
        <p>By submitting a restaurant or update request via the Site, you confirm that the information provided is accurate to the best of your knowledge. We reserve the right to accept, reject, or modify any submission. Submissions do not create any obligation on our part to publish or maintain a listing.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>All written content, editorial descriptions, design elements, and site structure are the property of gardenroute-restaurants.co.za. Restaurant names, logos, and trademarks remain the property of their respective owners. Ratings displayed are sourced from Google and are subject to Google's own terms of service.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">You may not reproduce, republish, or redistribute content from this Site without prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. External links</h2>
        <p>The Site contains links to third-party websites including restaurant websites, Google Maps, and booking platforms. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any third-party sites. Links are provided for convenience only.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, gardenroute-restaurants.co.za shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of this Site or reliance on any information contained herein, including but not limited to loss resulting from incorrect trading hours, closed restaurants, or changed contact details.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms & Conditions from time to time. The date of the most recent revision is shown at the top of this page. Continued use of the Site after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes arising from use of this Site shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the South African courts.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za</a>.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-100 py-8 px-6 mt-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
      <p>© 2026 gardenroute-restaurants.co.za</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-gray-600 no-underline">Terms</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-gray-600 no-underline">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:text-gray-600 no-underline">About</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>
